<chapter xml:id="Homework-assignments" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title> Homework Assignments </title>

  <introduction>
    <p> INSTRUCTIONS: Justify all statements. While you may ask for help and collaborate with others, the writing of the solutions needs to be in your own words, based on your own understanding.
    You may rely on standard results learned in the prerequisite class(es) you took and results that have been discussed in class or assigned for reading. Any other results should be used sparingly, if at all, and only if you can provide their proof. 
  </p>
  </introduction>

